{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370150","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1037015001:1":{"text":"체르테는 먼저 마을로 돌아갔어요.","source_cn":"契尔忒先回村子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C397E3BF955F49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037015002:1":{"text":"이틀 전에 방랑자가 무슨 일이 일어났는지 전부 알려줬어요.","source_cn":"前两天风语者传来消息，将之前发生的一切告知了我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13ADC4301AAD50C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037015003:1":{"text":"마을 근처에서 폭주하던 몬스터가 이미 사라지긴 했지만, 저흰 계속 불안하더라고요. 그래서 체르테는 마을 주민을 보호하러 먼저 돌아갔어요.","source_cn":"虽然村子附近发狂的怪物已经消失，但我们依然放心不下，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA275E81251CDC920","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守卫美特苏尔":{"text":"수비병 메트졸","source":"守卫美特苏尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}